      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOT A SETTING (6) was a course and distance placegetter (18.65) last time also from the same draw, finishing a 3.5 lengths third in a Grade 5. Deserves another chance. GOT A FORMULA (2) has missed the frame at her last two but did run well three back when third (18.55) in a Grade 5 at this track. Well placed here and should do much better. MASTER LEHIGH (1) was unwanted in betting last start but proved too quick with an all-the-way win over 306m at Lithgow in a Grade 3/4, scoring by 1.75 lengths (17.49). Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and two minor placings from five starts. Form should stack up. BRONTE LEE (3) picked up a cheque over this course and distance most recently - in the mix again.",
